# Allowlist: ignore everything, then explicitly un-ignore only what the
# Docker build needs (pyproject.toml, README.md, and the src/ package tree).
# This keeps tests, docs, OpenSpec history, git metadata, caches, local
# virtual environments, and build artifacts out of the build context
# without needing to enumerate each of them.
*

!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src
